// ---- the trap macros (R6): deferred bodies and the unbindable row ---------------------------

// ---- the bind macro (R5) -------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Per row rather than one shared macro, because the two row kinds differ in BOTH arms:
//
//   bindable  standalone -> the target, unconditionally (there is no ini to gate on)
//             hosted     -> the row's R11 arm bit decides: `[config] mode` sets them all, and
